    "detailed_description": "Customizable Sudoku with the feel<br>of writing with a pen on paper<br>and the ease of playing a video game.<br><br>It's a video game, but you can play it as if you were writing with a pen on paper.<br>You can customize the assist functions to your liking.<br><br><br>* Customize the assist functions and play with the settings you like.<br><br>Customize the assist functions to play with the settings you like.<br>We wanted to retain the feel of playing with pen and paper, but make it easier to play...!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286760/extras/fc290451d6cb45868a5ec5a7ac9a56da.poster.avif?t=1743175235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286760/extras/fc290451d6cb45868a5ec5a7ac9a56da.webm?t=1743175235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>...and other assist functions you can turn on/off any way you like.<br><br><br>*The game can be played anytime, anywhere, even if it takes a long time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286760/extras/47285873726d3064284c9b4f9a8d7868.avif?t=1743175235\" /></span><br><br>* Touch controls are supported.<br>Touch controls make it easy to play casually like you would on a smartphone app.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286760/extras/190c14fce78e8433431650c46aa58e97.avif?t=1743175235\" /></span><br><br>* There are a total of 300 problems in EASY, NORMAL, and HARD difficulty levels.<br>There are 300 problems in three difficulty levels: EASY, NORMAL, and HARD.",
